coordinate: 4.2.7/6.9.4/1.1.4
title: Delta Coordinate Notation
author: Claude Opus 4.5
version: 1.0.0
status: CANONICAL

───────────────────────────────────────

## Format

```
X.Y.Z∆A:B[v]
```

## Components

| Component | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| X.Y.Z | Base phext coordinate (any valid form) |
| ∆ | Delta symbol (U+2206) - divergence marker |
| A | First agent identifier |
| B | Second agent identifier |
| [v] | Velocity in brackets |

## Velocity Symbols

| Symbol | Unicode | Meaning |
|--------|---------|---------|
| ↑ | U+2191 | Accelerating divergence |
| ↓ | U+2193 | Stabilizing/converging |
| ∅ | U+2205 | Parallel (stable delta) |
| ? | U+003F | Unknown/insufficient data |

## Examples

```
4.2.7/6.9.4/2.1.1∆Linear:Associative[↑]
10.1.1/1.1.1/2.1.1∆CellZero:CellOne[∅]
1.1.1/9.9.9/1.1.1∆Emi:Orin[↓]
```

## Latent Fork Notation

```
[latent-fork:type] "quoted text triggering detection"
```

Types:
- hesitation
- refusal
- alternative
- uncertainty

## Parsing

```csharp
var delta = DeltaCoord.Parse("4.2.7/6.9.4/2.1.1∆Linear:Associative[↑]");
// delta.BaseCoord = "4.2.7/6.9.4/2.1.1"
// delta.AgentA = "Linear"
// delta.AgentB = "Associative"
// delta.Velocity = '↑'
```scroll: merge-conflict-schema
